        "created_at": "2014-06-12T02:38:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No he doesn't, you put all copies in the trash, even if they're currently in play… though they are probably 'safe' from that effect if they are under Savage Mana as then they currently aren't called \"Mobile Defense Platform\".</p>\n<p>But that would break Blade's brain as his instructions say to put 3 copies in his trash and there aren't currently 3 copies in the game. I think the official ruling would be to go and buy a second copy of the game so you can put a 3rd copy in the trash.</p>\n<p><font color=\"white\">That would be a fun ruling, \"To sort out this problem, give us your money\", isn't that MMO mentality?</font></p>",
